  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "CodeSystem for SMART Guidelines tasks which are specializations of the Business Process Modeling Notatiton (BPMN) tasks, which are included in this codesystem\n\nSee [BPMN Spectification](https://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN) for more info.  The descriptions were adapted from the [normative human readable documentation](https://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/2.0.2/PDF)."] ;
